   "fix": "Weaken the hypothesis to `(h\u03a6u : IsUnit (\u03a6 z\u2080))`. Both callers then pass `h\u03a6u z\u2080 (mem_ball_self hr)`. Better still, state the lemma at the germ level with `ContinuousAt \u03a6 z\u2080`, `IsUnit (\u03a6 z\u2080)`, `AnalyticAt \u2102 \u03c3 z\u2080` and `\u2200\u1da0 z in \ud835\udcdd z\u2080, f z = \u03a6 z (\u03c3 z)`, matching the existing `HasSimilarityFactorizationAt` (UniqueContinuation.lean:80).",
